 r←Test_GETRoot_ServesHTML url;ct;h;res
⍝ GET / serves the Swagger UI page (public, HTML, driven by /openapi.json)
 h←##.##.##.HttpCommand.New'GET'
 h.URL←url,'/'
 res←h.Run
 r←200=res.HttpStatus                    ⍝ served, and public (no API key)
 ct←res.GetHeader'content-type'
 r∧←∨/'text/html'⍷ct                      ⍝ HTML, not JSON-encoded
 r∧←∨/'SwaggerUIBundle'⍷res.Data          ⍝ Swagger UI bootstrapped
 r∧←∨/'swagger-ui'⍷res.Data
 r∧←∨/'/openapi.json'⍷res.Data            ⍝ points at the spec endpoint
